{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國國會中期選舉當地時間周二（11月3日）舉行，當地民調顯示，民主黨幾乎肯定能在周二的投票中，能夠在共和黨手中取得眾議院多數席位，並有望贏得參議院控制權。</p><p>美國總統特朗普表示，到時他可能會成為「否決先生」。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T02:20:24.278888+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":103,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T01:53:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T16:18:18.702123+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T02:18:07.084893+00:00","content_hash":"b103e7353fb9d1aaa4b859f0bc82935d0846c5e4e436062a3d5814770f3f3946","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}